WEBVTT

00:10:29.442 --> 00:10:33.624
(Applause)

00:10:33.794 --> 00:10:36.006
And because it's so badass,

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:38.739
those flags and crosses
are found throughout Amsterdam,

00:10:38.763 --> 00:10:41.193
just like Chicago, they're used.

00:10:41.955 --> 00:10:44.868
Even though seal-on-a-bedsheet flags
are particularly painful

00:10:44.892 --> 00:10:46.137
and offensive to me,

00:10:46.161 --> 00:10:48.740
nothing can quite prepare you

00:10:48.764 --> 00:10:51.845
for one of the biggest train wrecks
in vexillological history.

00:10:51.869 --> 00:10:53.113
(Laughter)

00:10:53.137 --> 00:10:54.287
Are you ready?

00:10:54.815 --> 00:10:57.570
It's the flag of Milwaukee, Wisconsin.

00:10:57.594 --> 00:11:04.594
(Laughter)